70bb56f3b8eec7a10864e49478129023 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-64es3r-70bb56f3b8eec7a10864e49478129023 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-3kfiuv-2652aab576dc2ec28143c9c04947eee4 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-3kfiuv-2652aab576dc2ec28143c9c04947eee4 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mnhde50i-27c27cfa70f821662a7f01f608482cea '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1876\">El mundo del autom\u00f3vil se re\u00fane en Argentina &#8211; \u00a1y VENOL MOTOR OIL estar\u00e1 all\u00ed! Este mes de abril nos dirigimos a Buenos Aires para Automechanika 2026.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1997\">Nos complace anunciar que el equipo de VENOL MOTOR OIL participar\u00e1 en la pr\u00f3xima feria Automechanika Buenos Aires 2026.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2241\">Este evento es una excelente oportunidad para presentar nuestra gama de productos y establecer nuevas relaciones comerciales en el mercado sudamericano. Si planea asistir, no dude en contactarnos y programar una reuni\u00f3n con nuestros expertos.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2316\">Cu\u00e1ndo: <strong>08\u201311 de abril de 2026<\/strong><br data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2280\" \/>D\u00f3nde: <strong>Buenos Aires, Argentina<br \/>\n<\/strong>Podr\u00e1n encontrarnos en el <strong>Pabell\u00f3n 1, stand J-19<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2427\"><strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2351\">Reserve su reuni\u00f3n hoy mismo:<\/strong><br data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2354\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 669 930 600 &#8211; Milena Kotynia<br data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2392\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 669 460 200 &#8211; Jan Fabisiak<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-2kqdfb-ec956750ac37909112480e580a5492cc av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mnhddktl-d15dd6d5b5b048ac8d7f57a7de23d877\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mnhddktl-d15dd6d5b5b048ac8d7f57a7de23d877 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-mnhddktl-d15dd6d5b5b048ac8d7f57a7de23d877 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-mnhddktl-d15dd6d5b5b048ac8d7f57a7de23d877 av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-5128 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-5128 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-5-1030x1030.jpeg\" alt='' title='Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026'  height=\"1030\" width=\"1030\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-5-1030x1030.jpeg 1030w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-5-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-5-80x80.jpeg 80w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-5-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-5-36x3